cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
title: >-
  edge-containers: production container images for NVIDIA Jetson edge GPUs -
  a streaming speech recognition and synthesis stack with a spec-driven
  benchmark harness
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - given-names: Mieszko
    family-names: Syty
    affiliation: "MS/1 Design"
repository-code: "https://github.com/GoBrrr-ai/edge-containers"
abstract: >-
  Container images for NVIDIA Jetson edge GPUs (Orin sm_87, Thor sm_110): a
  streaming voice stack - speech recognition (whisper, parakeet, nemotron,
  canary, moonshine, phonon), speech synthesis (piper, kokoro, phonon-31m,
  paradee, pocket-tts) and a llama.cpp server - plus a spec-driven benchmark
  harness with frozen manifests, dark-theme charts and a fully generated README.
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: "2026-11-06"
